     "name": "instance",
     "comment": "high: every allocation site (Grenade 0x5d728, Mine, Missile, Newton, ~ESpawnSmackable) copies the identity matrix to this+0x40 then calls RSceneObj(this+0x40), so sourceInstance points at this embedded 64-byte record: the object owns its own instance"
    }
